sequenceDiagram
    participant Cam as IP Camera
    participant Mtx as MediaMTX
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant Redis as Redis Queue
    participant AI as Inference Worker
    participant DB as TimescaleDB

    Cam->>Mtx: Streams RTSP Video
    BE->>Mtx: Connects to RTSP Feed
    loop Every N Frames
        BE->>BE: Extracts Frame (OpenCV)
        BE->>BE: Encodes to Base64
        BE->>Redis: RPUSH to 'inference_queue'
        Redis->>AI: BLPOP (Worker receives frame)
        
        AI->>AI: Image Preprocessing (Pillow to Tensor)
        AI->>AI: PyTorch TorchScript Inference (CUDA)
        AI->>AI: Non-Maximum Suppression (NMS)
        
        AI->>Redis: RPUSH detections to 'inference_result_<id>'
        Redis->>BE: BLPOP (Backend receives detections)
        
        alt Threat/Event Detected
            BE->>DB: Logs Event & Saves Snapshot Path
        end
    end
